                                                "sense_id": "49b0f98a-7143-3a65-bd2c-a00c5a2c9510",
                                                "text": "Some admired the external beauties of the objects they beheld, like the nightingale in love with the roſe; ſome inchanted by the concert around, like Suphys delighting in madneſs, toſſed the cup of exultation into the ſkies[.]\n[Footnote] Suphys are a sect of mad philoſophers."
